# Trivy ignore file — vendored dependencies inside setuptools._vendor
#
# setuptools bundles its own copies of jaraco.context and wheel in its
# internal _vendor/ namespace. These vendored copies are NOT independently
# importable or callable by application code — setuptools uses them
# strictly for its own package-installation internals.
#
# The standalone packages are patched:
#   jaraco.context  5.3.0 → 6.1.2  (installed at site-packages/)
#   wheel           0.45.1 → 0.47.0 (installed at site-packages/)
#
# setuptools 83.x still ships the old vendored versions and there is no
# upstream release that updates them yet. Suppressing until resolved.

# CVE-2026-23949 — jaraco.context: path traversal via malicious tar archives
CVE-2026-23949

# CVE-2026-24049 — wheel: privilege escalation via malicious wheel file
CVE-2026-24049
